Derived by Alto: albedo luminance matched to the procedural material it replaces, channels repacked (A = albedo + roughness,
B = normal X/Y + height + cavity), resized to 1024/512 px, encoded to KTX2 with Basis Universal (ETC1S / UASTC + Zstandard);
the HDRI's sun painted out, exposure scaled, lower hemisphere replaced, Reinhard-encoded.

